03:41:50.020 --> 03:41:52.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Thank you, Majority Leader.

asr-000762
03:41:52.020 --> 03:41:54.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Mr. Speaker, I vote no

asr-000763
03:41:54.020 --> 03:41:56.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: to the General

asr-000764
03:41:56.020 --> 03:41:58.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Appropriations Bill. Let me be fair.

asr-000765
03:41:58.020 --> 03:42:00.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The amendments added

asr-000766
03:42:00.020 --> 03:42:02.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: funds for classrooms, school safety,

asr-000767
03:42:02.020 --> 03:42:04.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: commuters, patients, and families.

asr-000768
03:42:04.020 --> 03:42:06.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: I acknowledge that.

asr-000769
03:42:06.020 --> 03:42:08.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: As stewards of taxpayers' money,

asr-000770
03:42:08.020 --> 03:42:10.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: we must ensure that ordinary

asr-000771
03:42:10.020 --> 03:42:12.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: people benefit from our collective

asr-000772
03:42:12.020 --> 03:42:14.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: choices. This budget has

asr-000773
03:42:14.020 --> 03:42:16.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: only 1.15 trillion

asr-000774
03:42:16.020 --> 03:42:18.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: in real fiscal space.

asr-000775
03:42:18.000 --> 03:42:24.360
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and after amendments, P541.5 billion, or nearly half of it, went to pork.

asr-000776
03:42:25.020 --> 03:42:30.180
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: AICS, MAIPF, Tupad, and cash aid nearly doubled from NEP levels,

asr-000777
03:42:30.460 --> 03:42:33.640
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: with P67.5 billion added at the BARSC.

asr-000778
03:42:34.300 --> 03:42:38.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Hard pork rose by P48.2 billion.

asr-000779
03:42:38.020 --> 03:42:43.600
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The DPWH convergence program alone gained P74.1 billion,

asr-000780
03:42:44.140 --> 03:42:47.780
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: while flood management was cut by P16.3 billion.

asr-000781
03:42:48.420 --> 03:42:51.260
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The LGSF, already the largest in history,

asr-000782
03:42:51.780 --> 03:42:56.820
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: rose to P62.6 billion on the year before the 2028 elections.

asr-000783
03:42:57.400 --> 03:42:59.980
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: What remains for initiatives that could propel our country

asr-000784
03:42:59.980 --> 03:43:04.640
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: is just 8.5% of the proposed 2027 budget.

asr-000785
03:43:04.880 --> 03:43:07.980
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Paano natin naayusin ang kalidad ng serbisyo

asr-000786
03:43:07.980 --> 03:43:11.080
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: kung kinakainan ng patronage ang pondo?

asr-000787
03:43:11.840 --> 03:43:14.020
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Patronage is not only about how much,

asr-000788
03:43:14.520 --> 03:43:16.700
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: it is also about how funds are distributed,

asr-000789
03:43:17.220 --> 03:43:17.980
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: where they go.

asr-000790
03:43:18.000 --> 03:43:19.380
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: When they are given,

asr-000791
03:43:19.780 --> 03:43:20.420
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: who benefits,

asr-000792
03:43:20.900 --> 03:43:21.560
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and ultimately,

asr-000793
03:43:22.020 --> 03:43:22.800
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: who decides.

asr-000794
03:43:23.320 --> 03:43:25.980
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Falgo was written into the 2027 NEP

asr-000795
03:43:25.980 --> 03:43:28.480
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: at P37.49 billion,

asr-000796
03:43:29.020 --> 03:43:30.700
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: exactly the same amount

asr-000797
03:43:30.700 --> 03:43:34.080
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: that the BICAM ballooned it to in the 2026 GAA.

asr-000798
03:43:34.660 --> 03:43:37.900
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Last year's insertion is this year's baseline.

asr-000799
03:43:38.400 --> 03:43:40.000
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: It has no cap per LGU

asr-000800
03:43:40.520 --> 03:43:43.260
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and no objective basis for who gets what.

asr-000801
03:43:43.260 --> 03:43:45.680
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Kapag palakasan ng basehan,

asr-000802
03:43:46.120 --> 03:43:47.260
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ang pondo ay nagiging kasangkapan

asr-000803
03:43:48.000 --> 03:43:48.740
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: sa politika,

asr-000804
03:43:49.240 --> 03:43:50.340
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: hindi sa pagunlad.

asr-000805
03:43:51.000 --> 03:43:52.440
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Naninindigan pa rin tayo

asr-000806
03:43:52.440 --> 03:43:53.860
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: na walang tuwang ang UA

asr-000807
03:43:53.860 --> 03:43:56.000
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: or unprogrammed appropriation

asr-000808
03:43:56.000 --> 03:43:57.140
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: sa pambansang budget.

asr-000809
03:43:57.700 --> 03:43:58.580
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Some will say,

asr-000810
03:43:58.960 --> 03:44:01.040
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: UA is not bloated this time.

asr-000811
03:44:01.420 --> 03:44:03.280
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: But discretion did not disappear.

asr-000812
03:44:03.860 --> 03:44:06.240
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Lumipat lang ang dagdag sa LGSF.

asr-000813
03:44:06.760 --> 03:44:07.720
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Iba lang ang pangalan,

asr-000814
03:44:08.220 --> 03:44:09.500
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: pareho pa rin ang pakay.

asr-000815
03:44:10.080 --> 03:44:12.260
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ang nakakadismaya sa lahat,

asr-000816
03:44:12.760 --> 03:44:14.060
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: saan kinuha ang pondo?

asr-000817
03:44:14.740 --> 03:44:17.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Reallocation is a zero-sum game.

asr-000818
03:44:17.120 --> 03:44:19.400
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: 130 billion was cut

asr-000819
03:44:19.400 --> 03:44:21.480
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: from the foreign-assisted projects

asr-000820
03:44:21.480 --> 03:44:23.580
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: or FAPs of DOTR,

asr-000821
03:44:23.720 --> 03:44:24.520
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: DPWH,

asr-000822
03:44:24.980 --> 03:44:26.000
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and other agencies.

asr-000823
03:44:26.520 --> 03:44:27.840
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: How will this be implemented

asr-000824
03:44:27.840 --> 03:44:29.920
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: when their line items are gone?

asr-000825
03:44:30.540 --> 03:44:32.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Our loan commitments remain.

asr-000826
03:44:33.340 --> 03:44:33.940
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Excuse me.

asr-000827
03:44:34.440 --> 03:44:35.260
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Pahalala lang po.

asr-000828
03:44:36.400 --> 03:44:37.820
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Pumabot na sa 1 billion

asr-000829
03:44:37.820 --> 03:44:39.860
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: ang commitment fees dahil sa delays

asr-000830
03:44:39.860 --> 03:44:42.920
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: because this chamber keeps defunding FAPs

asr-000831
03:44:42.920 --> 03:44:44.920
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and parking them in the UA.

asr-000832
03:44:44.920 --> 03:44:46.920
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: These are fiscally

asr-000833
03:44:47.120 --> 03:44:49.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: irresponsible choices.

asr-000834
03:44:49.120 --> 03:44:51.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The Constitution makes the President's budget

asr-000835
03:44:51.120 --> 03:44:53.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: of expenditures and sources of financing

asr-000836
03:44:53.120 --> 03:44:55.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: quote-unquote,

asr-000837
03:44:55.120 --> 03:44:57.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: the basis of the General Appropriations Bill.

asr-000838
03:44:57.120 --> 03:45:01.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: When we carve FAPs out of that program

asr-000839
03:45:01.120 --> 03:45:03.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: to make room for pork,

asr-000840
03:45:03.120 --> 03:45:05.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: we pass a ga'a that no longer matches

asr-000841
03:45:05.120 --> 03:45:07.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: its own financing plan.

asr-000842
03:45:07.120 --> 03:45:09.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: At hindi lang FAPs ang tinamaan.

asr-000843
03:45:09.120 --> 03:45:12.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Mas malaki ang kaltas sa health promotion,

asr-000844
03:45:12.120 --> 03:45:15.120
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: immunization and family planning commodities,

asr-000845
03:45:15.120 --> 03:45:16.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: classrooms against the

asr-000846
03:45:16.960 --> 03:45:19.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: 166,000 classroom backlog,

asr-000847
03:45:19.960 --> 03:45:23.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: consumer or consular services for OFWs,

asr-000848
03:45:23.960 --> 03:45:27.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: the NDRMM fund kung kailan may Super El Niño.

asr-000849
03:45:27.960 --> 03:45:30.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: The national budget is a moral document,

asr-000850
03:45:30.960 --> 03:45:34.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: our social contract with every Filipino taxpayer.

asr-000851
03:45:34.960 --> 03:45:37.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Dapat itaguyod ng budget na ito ang dignidad

asr-000852
03:45:37.960 --> 03:45:41.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: at kinabukasan ng Pilipino at ng ating bansa.

asr-000853
03:45:41.960 --> 03:45:44.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Instead, this budget tells our children,

asr-000854
03:45:44.960 --> 03:45:47.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: our sick, our OFWs, our commuters,

asr-000855
03:45:47.960 --> 03:45:49.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and our marginalized to suffer,

asr-000856
03:45:49.960 --> 03:45:51.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: while it tells the politically useful

asr-000857
03:45:51.960 --> 03:45:53.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: to come and collect.

asr-000858
03:45:53.960 --> 03:45:57.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ang budget na ito ay hindi people-centered.

asr-000859
03:45:57.960 --> 03:45:59.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Ito ay election-centered.

asr-000860
03:45:59.960 --> 03:46:01.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: For these reasons, Mr. Speaker,

asr-000861
03:46:01.960 --> 03:46:05.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Mamamayang Liberal or ML Party List votes no.

asr-000862
03:46:05.960 --> 03:46:07.960
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Maraming salamat po.

asr-000863
03:46:07.960 --> 03:46:09.960
Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: Majority Leader?

asr-000864
