Deputy Speaker Yasser Alonto Balindong: it's recognized you have three minutes.

asr-000869
03:46:21.960 --> 03:46:23.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: Mr. Speaker, I vote no

asr-000870
03:46:23.960 --> 03:46:25.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: because I cannot support a budget

asr-000871
03:46:25.960 --> 03:46:27.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: that raises serious concerns about fairness,

asr-000872
03:46:27.960 --> 03:46:30.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: accountability, and the urgent infrastructure needs

asr-000873
03:46:30.960 --> 03:46:33.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: of the highly urbanized city I represent,

asr-000874
03:46:33.960 --> 03:46:37.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: particularly my flood-stricken district.

asr-000875
03:46:37.960 --> 03:46:39.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: I vote no because our allocation

asr-000876
03:46:39.960 --> 03:46:41.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: has been declined dramatically

asr-000877
03:46:41.960 --> 03:46:44.800
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: from 1.774

asr-000878
03:46:44.800 --> 03:46:47.060
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: billion under the 2025

asr-000879
03:46:47.060 --> 03:46:49.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: General Appropriations Act,

asr-000880
03:46:49.960 --> 03:46:53.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: to 1.306 billion in 2026,

asr-000881
03:46:53.960 --> 03:46:58.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: and now to only 492.250 million

asr-000882
03:46:58.960 --> 03:47:01.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: under the proposed 2027

asr-000883
03:47:01.960 --> 03:47:04.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: National Expenditure Program, the NEP.

asr-000884
03:47:04.960 --> 03:47:07.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: This represents a reduction of approximately

asr-000885
03:47:07.960 --> 03:47:11.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: 62.33% from our 2026 allocations

asr-000886
03:47:11.960 --> 03:47:20.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: and 72.25% from our 2025 allocation.

asr-000887
03:47:20.960 --> 03:47:23.960
Rep. Rachel Marguerite B. Del Mar: I vote no because 280 million

asr-000888
03:47:23.960 --> 03:47:26.960
